{
  "version": 1,
  "_comment": "本项目在 .codebuddy 引擎与项目侧配置之间的唯一注册表，随引擎入库共享。路径基准为项目根（.codebuddy 的父目录）；全部为相对路径与占位值，对所有消费项目一致。files 的 template / rule_shells 的 template_outline 供 codebuddy-init 技能生成初始占位骨架。缺失、JSON 损坏或缺少必需键时，读取方必须报错退出（退出码 3），不回退内置默认值。迁移到新项目时，由 codebuddy-init 技能据此生成 .codebuddy.project/ 下的初始配置。",
  "project_config_root": ".codebuddy.project",
  "artifacts": {
    "_comment": "运行时产物目录（脚本执行过程中生成，不入库、不随引擎共享）。路径基准为项目根，由 codebuddy-init 在项目侧创建空目录；读取方经逻辑名定位（禁止绝对路径）。各产物目录由 .codebuddy.project/.gitignore 统一忽略。",
    "dirs": {
      "code_review.check_logs": ".codebuddy.project/skills/csharp-code-review/check_logs",
      "comment_checker.check_logs": ".codebuddy.project/skills/csharp-comment-checker/check_logs",
      "format_checker.check_logs": ".codebuddy.project/skills/csharp-format-checker/check_logs",
      "test_coverage.check_logs": ".codebuddy.project/skills/csharp-test-coverage/check_logs",
      "csharp_lsp.cache": ".codebuddy.project/skills/csharp-lsp/.cache",
      "unity_pipeline.cache": ".codebuddy.project/skills/unity-pipeline/.cache",
      "vcs_router.cache": ".codebuddy.project/skills/vcs-router/.cache",
      "vcs_router.lock": ".codebuddy.project/.vcs-lock",
      "session_distill.reports": ".codebuddy.project/skills/session-lesson-distill/reports"
    }
  },
  "root_symlinks": {
    "_comment": "引擎根下需以软链接外置到项目侧的单个文件（与项目专有技能目录软链接同理，依据 CodeBuddy 会解引用符号链接读取的实测事实）。link 为引擎内链接路径，path 为项目侧源文件路径，均为相对项目根的相对路径（只允许相对路径）。codebuddy-init 据此生成项目侧源文件骨架并建立软链接；读取方（CodeBuddy 本体）直接经软链接读取，无需脚本解析。这些文件随项目入库（源码）与引擎入库（链接）。",
    "entries": {
      "codebuddy.settings": {
        "link": ".codebuddy/settings.json",
        "path": ".codebuddy.project/settings.json",
        "format": "json",
        "template": {
          "language": "<界面与回复语言，如 简体中文>",
          "enabledPlugins": {
            "<插件名@市场名，如 csharp-lsp@codebuddy-plugins-official>": true
          },
          "enableAllProjectMcpServers": true,
          "enabledMcpjsonServers": [],
          "disabledMcpjsonServers": [],
          "memory": {
            "autoMemoryEnabled": false,
            "typedMemory": false,
            "relevanceSelection": false,
            "memoryExtraction": false,
            "teamMemory": {
              "enabled": false,
              "userId": "<团队成员标识，如 git 用户名>"
            }
          },
          "permissions": {
            "allow": [],
            "ask": [],
            "deny": [],
            "defaultMode": "auto"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "files": {
    "format_checker.config": {
      "path": ".codebuddy.project/skills/csharp-format-checker/config.json",
      "format": "json",
      "template": {
        "version": 1,
        "_comment": "本文件为 csharp-format-checker 的项目配置：workspace 指向目标项目的解决方案/工程文件，exclude_dirs 列出目标项目的三方库与生成代码目录。本文件是格式检查范围的唯一来源：配置缺失、损坏或缺少必需键时脚本直接报错退出（退出码 3），不回退内置默认值。",
        "workspace": "<解决方案或工程文件名，如 MyProject.slnx>",
        "groups": [
          "whitespace",
          "style"
        ],
        "severity": "warn",
        "no_restore": true,
        "changed_scope": {
          "_comment": "变更范围检查参数。max_projects 为可串行检查的工程数上限：每个工程需独立重载一次工作区，超过该值即回退整仓。",
          "max_projects": 3
        },
        "exclude_dirs": [
          "<三方库目录，如 Assets/Plugins>",
          "<包缓存目录，如 Library/PackageCache>",
          "<生成代码目录，如 Assets/<领域>/Generated>",
          ".codebuddy"
        ]
      }
    },
    "code_review.config": {
      "path": ".codebuddy.project/skills/csharp-code-review/config.json",
      "format": "json",
      "template": {
        "version": 1,
        "_comment": "本文件为 csharp-code-review 的项目配置：file_patterns 为纳入审查的文件模式，exclude_patterns 为排除清单（三方库、生成代码、审查范围外目录）。本文件是审查范围的唯一来源：配置缺失、损坏或缺少必需键时脚本直接报错退出（退出码 3），不回退内置默认值。口径须与 csharp-format-checker 配置的 exclude_dirs 保持一致。",
        "file_patterns": [
          "*.cs"
        ],
        "exclude_patterns": [
          "**/Generated/**",
          "**/Gen/**",
          "**/HybridCLRData/**",
          "*auto-generated*",
          "**/Assets/Plugins/**",
          "**/Library/PackageCache/**",
          "**/.codebuddy/**",
          "<项目自研包内嵌三方代码目录，如 **/ThreadLib/**>"
        ]
      }
    },
    "git_commit.config": {
      "path": ".codebuddy.project/skills/git-commit/config.json",
      "format": "json",
      "template": {
        "version": 1,
        "_comment": "本文件为 git-commit 的项目配置：提交摘要的 type 枚举、subject/scope 长度上限与 subject 语言。本文件是提交摘要约定的唯一来源：配置缺失、损坏或字段非法时校验脚本报错退出（退出码 3），不回退默认值。",
        "commit_subject": {
          "types": [
            "feat",
            "fix",
            "docs",
            "style",
            "refactor",
            "perf",
            "test",
            "chore",
            "ci",
            "revert"
          ],
          "subject_max_len": 50,
          "scope_max_len": 40,
          "subject_language": "zh"
        }
      }
    },
    "git_commit.project_config": {
      "path": ".codebuddy.project/skills/git-commit/project-config.md",
      "format": "markdown",
      "template_outline": [
        "# 版本控制项目配置（project-config）",
        "## 0. 关联配置",
        "## 1. Scope 规则（项目路径 → scope 映射）",
        "## 2. 提交 / 推送的发起权（参数）",
        "## 3. 提交前审查门禁（参数）",
        "## 4. H1 钩子步骤",
        "## 5. 项目专有检查说明"
      ]
    },
    "coverage.project_config": {
      "path": ".codebuddy.project/skills/csharp-test-coverage/tools/CSharpTestCoverage/coverage_config.project.json",
      "format": "json",
      "template": {
        "version": 1,
        "_comment": "本文件为 csharp-test-coverage 的项目相关配置，与引擎侧 tools/CSharpTestCoverage/coverage_config.json 的通用部分（规则、算法参数、映射策略）配合使用。runtimeRoots / scanScopes / namespaceMapping / realCoverage / exclude.paths 依赖目标项目结构，须按实际情况改写。配置缺失、损坏或缺必需键时脚本与工具直接报错退出（退出码 3）。",
        "exclude": {
          "paths": [
            "<生成代码目录，如 /Generated/>",
            "<自研包内嵌三方代码目录，如 /ThreadLib/>",
            "<三方库目录，如 /Assets/Plugins/>"
          ]
        },
        "runtimeRoots": [
          "<框架包源码根前缀，如 Packages/<包前缀>.>",
          "<游戏领域源码根，如 Assets/<领域>/Runtime>"
        ],
        "scanScopes": {
          "_comment": "未显式指定目标路径时，--scope 取值到扫描根目录的映射。",
          "all": [
            "Packages",
            "<领域 Runtime 目录>"
          ],
          "packages": [
            "Packages"
          ],
          "assets": [
            "<领域 Runtime 目录>"
          ]
        },
        "namespaceMapping": {
          "_comment": "UPM 包名 → C# 根命名空间，用于骨架生成的命名空间推导。键为包名前缀，值为对应命名空间；后缀按点分片首字母大写拼接。",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "package_prefix": "<包名前缀>",
              "namespace": "<命名空间>"
            }
          ]
        },
        "realCoverage": {
          "openCoverRoot": "<覆盖率产物目录，如 CodeCoverage/<项目名>-opencov>",
          "settingsPath": "<Code Coverage 设置文件路径>",
          "assemblyIncludePrefixes": [
            "<纳入采集的程序集前缀>"
          ],
          "frameworkPackagePrefix": "<框架包程序集前缀>"
        }
      }
    },
    "comment.project_config": {
      "path": ".codebuddy.project/skills/csharp-comment-checker/tools/CSharpCommentChecker/comment_config.project.json",
      "format": "json",
      "template": {
        "_comment": "本文件为 csharp-comment-checker 的项目相关配置，与引擎侧 tools/CSharpCommentChecker/comment_config.json 的 rules（规则与严重程度）配合使用。exclude.paths 列出目标项目应排除的目录（三方库、生成代码等），knownTerms 声明目标项目可保留英文的技术术语。配置缺失、损坏或缺少字段时工具直接报错退出（退出码 3）。",
        "exclude": {
          "paths": [
            "/Generated/",
            "/Gen/",
            "/Assets/Plugins/",
            "<自研包内嵌三方代码目录，如 /ThreadLib/>"
          ],
          "autoGenerated": true
        },
        "knownTerms": [
          "<项目保留英文的自研/选用技术术语，如自研库名、选用的第三方库名>",
          "MonoBehaviour",
          "Unity",
          "C#",
          "UI"
        ]
      }
    },
    "coverage.golden_samples": {
      "path": ".codebuddy.project/skills/csharp-test-coverage/scripts/golden_samples.json",
      "format": "json",
      "template": {
        "_comment": "本文件为 csharp-test-coverage 的黄金样本回归数据（本项目专属，声明本项目已知正确的覆盖率分析结果）。迁移到新项目时按目标项目实际情况重写，或清空 samples 数组。",
        "samples": []
      }
    },
    "coverage.trigger_cases": {
      "path": ".codebuddy.project/skills/csharp-test-coverage/scripts/trigger_cases.json",
      "format": "json",
      "template": {
        "_comment": "本文件为 csharp-test-coverage 的触发评估用例数据（含本项目专有路径示例）。结构为分桶用例集：should_trigger 为应触发、should_not_trigger 为不应触发、near_neighbor 为邻近易混淆；recommended_threshold 为判定阈值。迁移到新项目时替换含项目路径的用例即可。",
        "recommended_threshold": 0.3,
        "should_trigger": [
          "<应触发该技能的典型输入，如 检查 <目标包路径> 的测试覆盖率>"
        ],
        "should_not_trigger": [
          "<不应触发该技能的输入，如 写一个登录页面>"
        ],
        "near_neighbor": [
          "<邻近易混淆、易误触发的输入，如 运行单元测试看是否通过>"
        ]
      }
    },
    "format_checker.trigger_cases": {
      "path": ".codebuddy.project/skills/csharp-format-checker/evals/trigger/trigger_cases.json",
      "format": "json",
      "template": {
        "_comment": "本文件为 csharp-format-checker 的触发评估用例数据（含本项目专有路径与工程名示例）。结构为分桶用例集：should_trigger / should_not_trigger / near_neighbor。迁移到新项目时替换含项目路径的用例即可。",
        "should_trigger": [
          "<应触发该技能的典型输入，如 检查 <工程名> 的代码格式是否规范>"
        ],
        "should_not_trigger": [
          "<不应触发该技能的输入，如 检查测试覆盖率>"
        ],
        "near_neighbor": [
          "<邻近易混淆、易误触发的输入，如 检查代码注释是否规范>"
        ]
      }
    },
    "comment_checker.trigger_cases": {
      "path": ".codebuddy.project/skills/csharp-comment-checker/scripts/trigger_cases.json",
      "format": "json",
      "template": {
        "_comment": "本文件为 csharp-comment-checker 的触发评估用例数据（含本项目专有路径与术语示例）。结构为分桶用例集：should_trigger / should_not_trigger / near_neighbor。迁移到新项目时替换含项目路径/术语的用例即可。",
        "should_trigger": [
          "<应触发该技能的典型输入，如 检查 <目标文件> 的注释是否规范>"
        ],
        "should_not_trigger": [
          "<不应触发该技能的输入，如 检查代码格式>"
        ],
        "near_neighbor": [
          "<邻近易混淆、易误触发的输入，如 检查测试覆盖率>"
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "rule_shells": {
    "rules/project-guide/RULE.mdc": {
      "path": ".codebuddy.project/rules/project-guide/RULE.mdc",
      "format": "markdown",
      "template_outline": [
        "# 项目指导",
        "## 项目概述",
        "## 架构总览",
        "## 子规则路由表",
        "## 代码风格指引",
        "## 加载机制说明"
      ]
    },
    "rules/project-guide/architecture.mdc": {
      "path": ".codebuddy.project/rules/project-guide/architecture.mdc",
      "format": "markdown",
      "template_outline": [
        "# 架构细则",
        "## 目录结构",
        "## 包依赖",
        "## 领域分层",
        "## 启动流程",
        "## 状态机与生命周期",
        "## 调试端口",
        "## 第三方工具链"
      ]
    },
    "rules/project-guide/commands.mdc": {
      "path": ".codebuddy.project/rules/project-guide/commands.mdc",
      "format": "markdown",
      "template_outline": [
        "# 常用命令",
        "## Unity 打开",
        "## 构建",
        "## 测试",
        "## CDN 模拟"
      ]
    },
    "rules/project-guide/dependencies.mdc": {
      "path": ".codebuddy.project/rules/project-guide/dependencies.mdc",
      "format": "markdown",
      "template_outline": [
        "# 第三方依赖",
        "## UPM 包",
        "## 本地插件",
        "## NuGet 手动安装包"
      ]
    },
    "rules/project-guide/git-ignore.mdc": {
      "path": ".codebuddy.project/rules/project-guide/git-ignore.mdc",
      "format": "markdown",
      "template_outline": [
        "# Git 忽略内容清单",
        "## 已忽略需重建",
        "## 产物入库的 Gen 目录",
        "## 未被忽略规则覆盖的生成目录"
      ]
    },
    "rules/project-guide/testing.mdc": {
      "path": ".codebuddy.project/rules/project-guide/testing.mdc",
      "format": "markdown",
      "template_outline": [
        "# 测试约束",
        "## 程序集限制",
        "## 断言与测试运行器",
        "## 内存与池化约束"
      ]
    },
    "rules/csharp-code/architecture-spec.mdc": {
      "path": ".codebuddy.project/rules/csharp-code/architecture-spec.mdc",
      "format": "markdown",
      "template_outline": [
        "# 架构与性能审查 —— 项目事实",
        "## 框架包依赖顺序",
        "## 领域分层",
        "## 热更新程序集清单"
      ]
    },
    "rules/csharp-lsp/RULE.mdc": {
      "path": ".codebuddy.project/rules/csharp-lsp/RULE.mdc",
      "format": "markdown",
      "template_outline": [
        "# C# LSP 使用规则 —— 项目事实",
        "## 实际搜索目录",
        "## 受 LSP 索引影响的程序集（实测）"
      ]
    },
    "rules/csharp-test/naming-layout.mdc": {
      "path": ".codebuddy.project/rules/csharp-test/naming-layout.mdc",
      "format": "markdown",
      "template_outline": [
        "# 测试文件命名 —— 项目事实",
        "## 存量对齐现状",
        "## 生成测试代码豁免的实测教训"
      ]
    }
  }
}
